  "description": "Hi Team,\n\nBefore we start the next build, please run\u202f`npm install` to pull in all dependencies. The build will stage the web assets by copying\u202f`src/index.html` and\u202f`src/style.css` into\u202f`/var/www/html`, and will also place the configuration file\u202f`config/default.json` into\u202f`/etc/config`. All temporary files should be placed under\u202f`/tmp/build` while the process runs. Our application connects to the PostgreSQL database at\u202f`db.example.com` on port\u202f5432, using the credentials \u2013 user\u202f`app_user`, password\u202f`s3cureP@ssw0rd` \u2013 and will operate on the\u202f`app_db` database.\n\nOnce the files are in place, execute the test suite with\u202f`npm test -- --tags integration`. The test run should focus on the integration and API tags, so make sure both \u201cintegration\u201d and \u201capi\u201d are included. If any step fails, the workflow will pause for investigation; otherwise it will continue automatically. Let me know if you encounter any issues.",
  "reference_json": {
    "beforeCmd": "npm install",
    "copySources": [
      {
        "destination": "/var/www/html",
        "source": [
          "src/index.html",
          "src/style.css"
        ]
      },
      {
        "destination": "/etc/config",
        "source": "config/default.json"
      }
    ],
    "db": {
      "host": "db.example.com",
      "port": 5432,
      "user": "app_user",
      "pass": "s3cureP@ssw0rd",
      "name": "app_db"
    },
    "pause": "onFailure",
    "testCmd": "npm test -- --tags integration",
    "testTags": [
      "integration",
      "api"
    ],
    "tmpDir": "/tmp/build"
  }
